# Paradise, Salvation, and Maps (otherAreas 68): the Sacrarium's Treasure Chest (a script: xi.treasure's). CoP Slanderous
# Utterings current. The chest has no fixed spot: xi.treasure.initZone moves it 10 s after the zone loads to one of its
# eight spots (a draw: the seeded run puts it at spot 5, J-10, 179.709 -7.693 -97.007), hidden for 5 s after its move
# (hideNPC); 15 s after the login the engine still answers its talk with a release only (a scratch record), 30 s after
# it the chest shows. trigger walks to where it is (its script's onTrigger: the key it wants, CHEST_UNLOCKED - 8).
# Available: a trade (a feather): no section: the chest's script (no key: CHEST_UNLOCKED + 7). Accepted (a GM): with the
# floorplans (a GM): nil, the script; Option 2 (a GM) without them: nil, the script. Option 0: a feather: xi.treasure's
# no-key message, Option 5 (the char stands within 2 yalms of spot 5), noAction. Option 0 (a GM), the char 4 yalms off:
# the key: xi.treasure's too-far message, Option 0 (no spot within 2), noAction. Back at the chest: the key: opened (a
# zone key never fails), Option 5, noAction; 2 s on: the floorplans (the timer), the chest moves. Tavnazian Safehold:
# Nivorajean 225 (4), option 0: Prog 2.
lists TavnazianSafehold/Nivorajean/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/223 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/225 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/227 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/228 Sacrarium/Treasure_Chest/onTrade
lists Sacrarium/Treasure_Chest/onTrigger
char zone=Sacrarium pos=30,-2,99 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop SlanderousUtterings current
item SacrariumChestKey
item ChocoboFeather
login
tick 15000                              # the chest placed (initZone's moveTreasure) and shown
tick 15000
trigger Treasure_Chest at=1             # the chest's script (xi.treasure.onTrigger)
finish-if-event
trade Treasure_Chest ChocoboFeather x1  # available: no section; the chest's script: no key
quest OtherAreas.ParadiseSalvationAndMaps accepted # a GM
keyitem PieceOfRippedFloorplans         # a GM
trade Treasure_Chest ChocoboFeather x1  # the floorplans held: nil; the chest's script
delkeyitem PieceOfRippedFloorplans      # a GM
charvar Quest[4][68]Option 2            # a GM
trade Treasure_Chest ChocoboFeather x1  # Option 2: nil; the chest's script
charvar Quest[4][68]Option 0            # a GM
trade Treasure_Chest ChocoboFeather x1  # Option 0: xi.treasure: no key; Option 5; noAction
charvar Quest[4][68]Option 0            # a GM
walk 183.709,-7.693,-97.007             # 4 yalms east of the chest
trade Treasure_Chest SacrariumChestKey x1 # too far: xi.treasure's message; Option 0 (no spot within 2); noAction
trigger Treasure_Chest at=1             # back at the chest
finish-if-event
trade Treasure_Chest SacrariumChestKey x1 # opened: Option 5; noAction
tick 2500                               # the timer: the floorplans; the chest moves
tick 2500
warp 17.4,-22,13.3 TavnazianSafehold
trigger Nivorajean                      # the floorplans: 225 (4)
finish option=0                         # Prog 2
